    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL SELECT para BigQuery que calcula las estadísticas descriptivas solicitadas para las fechas de inicio de diagnóstico de condiciones:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(AVG(UNIX_DATE(condition_start_date)) AS INT64)) AS mean_start_date,\n    STDDEV(UNIX_DATE(condition_start_date)) AS stddev_days_from_epoch, -- La desviación estándar se expresa en días desde el epoch\n    DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(UNIX_DATE(condition_start_date), 100)[OFFSET(25)] AS INT64)) AS p25_start_date,\n    DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(UNIX_DATE(condition_start_date), 100)[OFFSET(50)] AS INT64)) AS p50_median_start_date,\n    DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(UNIX_DATE(condition_start_date), 100)[OFFSET(75)] AS INT64)) AS p75_start_date\nFROM\n    `condition_occurrence`;\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CnwBjz1rX0Wx8Rq-kNLs6rPaq4UP_z0VoOoFqwy93JPRd3z9kegJpKMVnPKUc7cfsVRNpZR5_MLFMe144n1XJbfkK4tgaHc5mCMEoGr0Ljwifehbn8YLtIzjoT_oAQjC4xPTv_2-irQIaMaTWkCy95I_KoE2hMYWb7YiFTEk"
